msgid "Increases healing magic potency by 50% and maximum HP by 30%, while reducing damage dealt by 5%.<br>Cannot be used with other <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Wisdom</ui-edge-color></ui-color> abilities.<br>Effect ends upon reuse or upon replacement of duty action."
