msgid "Increases maximum HP by 10% and accuracy by 30%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Grants a 70% chance of automatic revival upon KO<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 180m"
