msgid "Grants a stack of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Boost</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, up to a maximum of 16.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Boost Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Increases potency of next weaponskill by 30% per stack<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30s<br>Shares a recast timer with all other weaponskills and spells."
