msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 300.<br>Can only be executed immediately after evading an attack.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Slow</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +20%<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30s"
